---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Framework from '../components/Framework.astro';
---
<SiteLayout
  title="PairPilotFX"
  description="Structured forex decision support built around context, relative strength, market structure, liquidity, confirmation, and risk."
  canonicalPath="/"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="pill"><span class="status-dot"></span> Structured FX Decision Support</div>
        <p class="eyebrow">PairPilotFX</p>
        <h1>Guiding Better<br/><span>Trading Decisions.</span></h1>
        <p class="lead">
          Filter market noise. Focus on the pairs, levels, and conditions that deserve your attention.
          PairPilotFX turns market context into a repeatable decision process.
        </p>
        <div class="button-row">
          <a
            class="button"
            href="/weekly/"
            data-analytics-event="weekly_brief_cta_click"
            data-analytics-placement="hero"
          >
            Get the Weekly FX Brief <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <a
            class="button button-secondary"
            href="/about/"
            data-analytics-event="methodology_cta_click"
            data-analytics-placement="hero"
          >
            Explore the methodology
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-note">Scenario-based research. No signals. No guaranteed outcomes.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="brand-banner card">
          <img
            src="/brand/pairpilotfx-banner.svg"
            width="820"
            height="312"
            alt="PairPilot FX — Guiding Better Trading Decisions"
            loading="eager"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="terminal card" aria-label="Illustration of the PairPilotFX filtering process">
          <div class="terminal-bar">
            <span>PAIRPILOT / MARKET FILTER</span>
            <span class="live">FRAMEWORK</span>
          </div>
          <div class="scan-row"><span>01</span><strong>CONTEXT</strong><em>macro mapped</em></div>
          <div class="scan-row"><span>02</span><strong>STRENGTH</strong><em>relative edge</em></div>
          <div class="scan-row"><span>03</span><strong>STRUCTURE</strong><em>D1 / H4 / H1</em></div>
          <div class="scan-row"><span>04</span><strong>LIQUIDITY</strong><em>decision area</em></div>
          <div class="scan-row"><span>05</span><strong>CONFIRMATION</strong><em>condition required</em></div>
          <div class="scan-row"><span>06</span><strong>RISK</strong><em>invalidation defined</em></div>
          <div class="terminal-result">
            <span>PROCESS</span>
            <strong>FILTER → FOCUS → PREPARE</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="container"><div class="rule"></div></div>

  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="container trust-grid">
      <div><strong>Context first</strong><span>Start with the market environment, not a chart pattern.</span></div>
      <div><strong>Selective by design</strong><span>Not every pair deserves attention every week.</span></div>
      <div><strong>Confirmation required</strong><span>A scenario is not an entry until its condition is met.</span></div>
      <div><strong>Risk stays explicit</strong><span>Invalidation belongs in the process from the start.</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="framework">
    <div class="container stack framework-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">The PairPilot framework</p>
      <h2>A structured path from market noise to a decision.</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        PairPilotFX does not begin by asking what to trade. It begins by asking what the evidence supports,
        what still needs confirmation, and what would invalidate the idea.
      </p>
      <Framework />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">What PairPilotFX provides</p>
          <h2>Research built to improve the preparation process.</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="muted">
          The goal is not more predictions. It is a clearer process for deciding where attention belongs.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-3 product-grid">
        <article class="card card-pad">
          <span class="card-index">01 / WEEKLY</span>
          <h3>PairPilot Weekly</h3>
          <p>Macro context, currencies in focus, market structure, event risk, and scenario-based preparation for the week ahead.</p>
          <a
            href="/weekly/"
            data-analytics-event="weekly_brief_cta_click"
            data-analytics-placement="weekly_product_card"
          >Explore the Weekly Brief →</a>
        </article>
        <article class="card card-pad">
          <span class="card-index">02 / RECAP</span>
          <h3>Weekly Market Recap</h3>
          <p>A structured review of what the market actually did against the scenarios and filters established before the week unfolded.</p>
          <a
            href="https://pairpilotfx.substack.com/"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            data-analytics-event="substack_click"
            data-analytics-placement="recap_product_card"
            data-analytics-outbound="substack"
            data-utm-campaign="site_research"
          >Follow the research →</a>
        </article>
        <article class="card card-pad">
          <span class="card-index">03 / RADAR</span>
          <h3>PairPilot Radar</h3>
          <p>A developing decision-support system designed to filter a trading universe before deeper chart analysis begins.</p>
          <a
            href="/about/#radar"
            data-analytics-event="radar_cta_click"
            data-analytics-placement="radar_product_card"
          >Understand the approach →</a>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="free-tool-promo card">
        <div>
          <span class="card-index">FREE TOOL / AVAILABLE NOW</span>
          <h3>PairPilot Trade Preparation Checklist</h3>
          <p>
            Work through Context, Strength, Structure, Liquidity, Confirmation, and Risk before treating
            a scenario as fully prepared. Your answers stay saved locally on your device.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a
          class="button"
          href="/tools/trade-preparation-checklist/"
          data-analytics-event="free_tool_cta_click"
          data-analytics-placement="homepage_tool_promo"
        >Open the free checklist →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container cta card">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Start with the weekly brief</p>
        <h2>Trade fewer assumptions.<br/>Prepare with more structure.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-side">
        <p>Get PairPilotFX research and framework-based market preparation in your inbox.</p>
        <a
          class="button"
          href="/weekly/"
          data-analytics-event="weekly_brief_cta_click"
          data-analytics-placement="closing_cta"
        >Get the Weekly FX Brief →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container disclaimer">
    <strong>Risk note</strong>
    <p>
      PairPilotFX provides educational market commentary and decision-support content. It does not provide
      individualized investment advice, guaranteed outcomes, or autonomous trade execution.
    </p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .hero { padding: 108px 0 84px; overflow: hidden; }
  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.12fr) minmax(380px, .88fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 58px;
  }
  .hero-copy { display: grid; gap: 24px; }
  .hero-copy .eyebrow { margin: 10px 0 -10px; }
  .hero h1 span {
    color: transparent;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f8fbff, #79bdff 70%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
  }
  .hero-note { color: #7f96ae; font-size: .84rem; }
  .status-dot {
    width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--success);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(101,211,162,.08);
  }
  .hero-visual { display: grid; gap: 16px; }
  .brand-banner { overflow: hidden; background: #fff; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  .brand-banner img { width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .terminal { overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  .terminal-bar {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;
    padding: 15px 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: #7f96ae; font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .11em;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.025);
  }
  .terminal-bar .live { color: var(--accent-strong); }
  .scan-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 34px 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 17px 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
  }
  .scan-row span { color: #55708a; font: 700 .72rem/1 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .scan-row strong { font: 800 .77rem/1 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .scan-row em { color: #85a0b9; font: normal .76rem/1 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .terminal-result {
    display: grid; gap: 7px; padding: 24px 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(88,166,255,.07), rgba(88,166,255,.02));
  }
  .terminal-result span { color: #668199; font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .12em; }
  .terminal-result strong { color: #bfe0ff; font: 800 .91rem/1.3 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .trust-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); gap: 28px; }
  .trust-grid div { display: grid; gap: 7px; }
  .trust-grid strong { color: white; font-size: .9rem; }
  .trust-grid span { color: var(--muted); font-size: .82rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .framework-heading { gap: 22px; }
  .framework-heading > .lead { margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .section-heading {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.25fr .75fr;
    gap: 50px;
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: 34px;
  }
  .section-heading .muted { max-width: 430px; justify-self: end; }
  .product-grid .card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; min-height: 280px; }
  .product-grid p { color: var(--muted); }
  .product-grid a { margin-top: auto; color: var(--accent-strong); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 750; font-size: .9rem; }
  .card-index { color: #668199; font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: .13em; }
  .free-tool-promo {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 32px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 38px);
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(88,166,255,.08), rgba(255,255,255,.02));
  }
  .free-tool-promo > div { display: grid; gap: 12px; }
  .free-tool-promo p { color: var(--muted); max-width: 760px; }
  .free-tool-promo .button { white-space: nowrap; }
  .cta {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr;
    gap: 52px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: clamp(30px, 5vw, 58px);
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 90% 0%, rgba(88,166,255,.15), transparent 28rem),
      linear-gradient(140deg, rgba(18,38,61,.95), rgba(8,21,37,.95));
  }
  .cta-side { display: grid; gap: 20px; color: #bfd0e1; }
  .cta-side .button { width: fit-content; }
  .disclaimer {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 20px;
    padding-top: 0; padding-bottom: 72px;
    color: #7890a8; font-size: .78rem;
  }
  .disclaimer strong { color: #9ab1c7; white-space: nowrap; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero { padding-top: 78px; }
    .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .terminal { max-width: 650px; }
    .trust-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
    .section-heading, .cta { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .section-heading .muted { justify-self: start; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .trust-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .scan-row { grid-template-columns: 28px 1fr; }
    .scan-row em { grid-column: 2; }
    .disclaimer { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 7px; }
  }
</style>
